      "id": 119128,
      "name": "McBehrer",
      "username": "McBehrer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-15T06:38:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Man, I'd love to, and that does look like fun... I even have 2 friends who are good at the game, and would probably be willing to drive with me down there. Hell, one of them has done it before, for the Vengeance party. The issues are twofold.</p><p>First is lodging. Sure, we could stay at a hotel, but that costs money, on top of the $30 entry fee. It's at 9 in the morning, so unless we left at 4 in the morning we would HAVE to stay the night.</p><p>Second... That's the day after the new Smash Bros for the Wii U comes out, so we may be preoccupied...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, I'll see if we can work something out. If we can figure it out, then I'll be there. I'll also be bringing BattleCon, Smash 3DS, and other stuff, so no getting out of that, either.</p>",
